## handout<sub>models</sub>

-   cube<sub>bad.tri</sub>: a cube missing one of its faces (to test mesh repair)
-   tetrahedron<sub>hole.tri</sub>: a tetrahedron missing one of its faces (to also test repair)
-   pinchtetra.tri: two tetrahedra joined by a single vertex (to test pinch point)


